        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We designed our platform to comprehensively address key workflows for trades businesses including call tracking, scheduling, dispatching, end-customer communications, marketing automation, estimating, sales, payments, inventory and payroll integration.",
